00:40:19.570 --> 00:40:21.590
about 40 million years ago.

00:40:30.480 --> 00:40:34.080
But how could Gigantophis tackle one of these?

00:40:39.010 --> 00:40:41.570
It didn't use venom to kill its prey.

00:40:41.950 --> 00:40:49.260
