Those Victorian pioneer scientists, led by Professor Richard Owen,

00:42:45.590 --> 00:42:48.510
worked out that they were too old to be mammals

00:42:48.510 --> 00:42:53.030
and were certainly not fish, they were reptiles.

00:42:57.600 --> 00:42:59.960
Owen and his friends called them Ich die.

00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:29.970
dinosaurs, fish lizards. It's got skin and flesh on it. You can see how remarkably similar it is to

