But not so long ago, someone in South America found a sauropod egg, and inside...

00:53:21.756 --> 00:53:22.256
There was.

00:53:22.556 --> 00:53:23.696
baby sore upon.

00:53:24.668 --> 00:53:27.628
On its nose, it has a little egg tooth.

