We know that baby sauropods are very small.

00:54:21.308 --> 00:54:23.068
and left their nest very early.

00:54:23.164 --> 00:54:25.464
Perhaps to avoid being trampled upon,

00:54:25.472 --> 00:54:26.912
by their huge mothers.

00:54:34.924 --> 00:54:38.264
They probably hid in the forest until they grew large enough.

00:54:38.444 --> 00:54:39.944
to join the herd of adults.

